        "original_id": "c744a920-6f35-5c0a-b41f-0bd466de9642",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Saw II: Flesh & Blood, Saw 3D\n- People: Kevin Greutert, Patrick Melton, Marcus Dunstan, Tobin Bell, Costas Mandylor, Betsy Russell, Sean Patrick Flanery, Cary Elwes\n- Topics: release timing, film identity\n\nFacts:\n- Saw II: Flesh & Blood was released in 2010 to coincide with the release of Saw 3D one week later.\n- Saw 3D is a 2010 American 3D horror film.\n- Saw 3D is also known as Saw: The Final Chapter and Saw VII.\n- Kevin Greutert directed Saw 3D.\n- Patrick Melton and Marcus Dunstan wrote Saw 3D.\n- Tobin Bell, Costas Mandylor, Betsy Russell, Sean Patrick Flanery, and Cary Elwes starred in Saw 3D.",
